OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother very warm day with
OL,6,Fvariable cloud and some sunshine.
OL,7,FMostly dry morning but with a few
OL,8,Fsharp showers developing in the
OL,9,Fafternoon with a chance of hail and
OL,10,Fthunder.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers fade out in the
OL,13,Fevening to leave some clear spells
OL,14,Fbefore cloud and further showery rain
OL,15,Fspreads east, clearing in the early
OL,16,Fhours to allow some clear spells.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FA mix of variable cloud and
OL,19,Fsome bright spells with a scattering
OL,20,Fof light showers. Temperatures
OL,21,Freturning back to near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
