OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry at the weekend with variable cloud
OL,7,Fand bright spells, and just a few
OL,8,Flight showers on Saturday. Likely
OL,9,Fturning wet and windy through Monday.
